OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy evening, largely dry with just
OL,7,Fthe odd spot of rain around the coast.
OL,8,FSimilar overnight with perhaps a few
OL,9,Fclearer spells in the west. Rather
OL,10,Fcold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA dry day with bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Sunny spells will become
OL,14,Fincreasingly long with mostly clear
OL,15,Fskies by the end of the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
